  "body": "Located in sought-after Castor Bay and held by the same family for over 50 years, a testament to how good this location truly is. The current home was built in the 1990’s and is now ready for its new owners to enjoy. \r\n\r\nThis well presented brick and cedar home offers a perfect balance of privacy, convenience, and lifestyle. Upstairs open-plan kitchen, living, and dining areas flow effortlessly through large doors to a sun-drenched deck - ideal for both relaxing and entertaining. Spacious master suite with wardrobes and generous bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises two bedrooms, a bathroom, separate laundry, a second living area, and access outside to a lovely private garden and courtyard area. \r\n\r\nFenced outdoor area, ample storage plus a double garage with internal access. Close proximity to excellent schools, beautiful beaches, and local amenities, this home is a must-see. \r\n\r\nExpressions of Interest Close | Wednesday 9th December 2026 at 4pm (unless sold prior)",
